# QA M5 regression (D-090; was qa_m5_bug_zaunerstollen_under_hud): the
# Zaunerstollen box and its 1-up stay clear of the HUD band (y 0-21,
# D-029). The bug: with the box at (173, row 4) (D-087) the dead zone held
# the camera at y 53 on the perch (row 8), so the box was drawn at screen y
# 11-27 and the 1-up rose to ~1-11, behind „LEBEN". Now the camera rests
# at ground top - 84 = 44 on the perch (D-090 high-ground rest) and the box
# is on row 5 (world y 80-96, screen 36-52 at rest): bumped at 3304, the
# item rises from screen y 41, rolls along the box top at hitbox screen y
# 26 (sprite top 24, its hitbox is 2 px below the sprite's top), drops
# onto the perch at ~3362, turns at the bollard's side and comes back to
# her (ExtraLife 3396, lives 4). The replay format can't check screen y:
# `tests::lake::the_zaunerstollen_stays_clear_of_the_hud` replays this file
# and checks the item's drawn top >= 22 on every frame.
# Inputs: qa_m5_zaunerstollen_returns (as wolfgangsee_traundl up the perch;
# Gelse #3 stomped clear of the box at 3255, a standing jump under the box
# at 3301 bumps it). Shots: the item rising out of the box, rolling along
# its top, at its right edge. They become goldens after art-director
# review.
